Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add Gym Phase 1: equipment selection, exercises, filter &
 swap
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add GYM_EQUIPMENT_CATEGORIES (8 categories, ~40 equipment items)
- Add WORKOUT_PLANS_GYM.p1 with 5 days (Push/Pull/Legs/Upper/Cardio)
  and ~35 exercises with equipment[], movementPattern, and tip fields
- Add gym-setup-overlay for tap-to-select equipment tile grid
- Add openGymSetup(), toggleGymEquipment(), saveGymSetup() functions
- Add selectAllGymEquipment() and updateGymSetupCount() helpers
- Add getFilteredExercises() — filters by movementPattern + equipment
- Update getActivePlan() to return gym plan when gymMode is active
- Update toggleGymMode() to auto-open setup on first gym activation
- Add exercise-swap-overlay (bottom sheet) with alternative exercises
- Add openExerciseSwap(), swapExercise(), closeExerciseSwap()
- Add Swap button on each gym exercise (same movementPattern alts)
- Add "Gym-Setup ändern" card in Settings screen
- settings.gymSetup[] persisted in af_meta

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
